# Tool lifecycle profiles for cache-intel.sh (test --lifecycle).
# Format: tool|fixture_paths (comma-separated, repo-relative)|install_cmd|clean_paths (comma-separated)|unset_env (comma-separated)|optional_notes
#
# Fixture paths must exist in the repo. Install commands run with fixture as cwd.
# clean_paths are removed after save and before warm restore (repo-relative globs expanded with find where needed).

pnpm|test/fixtures/pnpm-projects/ufo-pnpm9,test/fixtures/pnpm-projects/pathe12|pnpm install --frozen-lockfile|.pnpm-store,node_modules/.pnpm-store,node_modules|PNPM_CONFIG_CACHE_DIR,pnpm_config_store_dir|Requires pnpm on PATH
composer|test/fixtures/composer-simple|composer install --no-interaction --prefer-dist|.cache/composer,vendor|COMPOSER_CACHE_DIR,COMPOSER_HOME|Requires composer on PATH; skip fixture if missing
cargo|test/fixtures/cargo-simple|cargo fetch --locked|.cache/cargo,target|CARGO_HOME|Requires rust/cargo on PATH; skip fixture if missing
